      "created_at": "2018-08-16T18:24:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That's pretty cool news!&nbsp; I have a modest collection of Cheapass games myself, though I stopped looking at them once they started going premium.&nbsp; Kind of funny that &gt;G is leaning toward the premium model (Prime War and Spirit Island at $80) and then acquiring Cheapass.&nbsp; An $80 version of Give Me The Brain would be ironically humorous.</p>",
